# 🎯 QUIZ MASTER PROJECT

A C++ console-based quiz game featuring multiple quiz categories, scoring, and a high-score system.

## 🚀 How to Run

### 1. Download the Project

Clone this repository:

git clone https://github.com/tirth69dev/QUIZ-MASTER-PROJECT.git


### 2. Open the Project

Open the downloaded `QUIZ-MASTER-PROJECT` folder in **VS Code** or any C++ IDE.

### 3. Compile the Program

Make sure you have a C++ compiler such as **g++** installed.

Run:

g++ main.cpp -o quiz


### 4. Run the Quiz

On Windows:

quiz.exe

On Linux/macOS:

./quiz


## 🎮 Features

* Multiple quiz categories
* Multiple-choice questions
* Score tracking
* High-score system
* Player names
* Interactive console interface

